[stderr] ## Approval gates and unanswered questions
[stderr] 
[stderr] - Select technology, repository, engine/framework, vendors, CI/CD, cost model,
[stderr]   browser/device/network matrix, storage quota, and performance budget.
[stderr] - Decide whether the apparently contradictory account, multiplayer, safety,
[stderr]   live-service, and commerce requirements are cancelled, later scope, or a
[stderr]   separately funded product. Define ownership, consent, retention/deletion,
[stderr]   support, and degraded modes before implementation.
