[stderr] +# 05 — Delivery map
[stderr] +
[stderr] +**Inputs:** [product brief](../specification/01-product-brief.md), [feature model](../specification/02-feature-model.md), [technical contract](../specification/03-technical-contract.md), and [experience contract](../specification/04-experience-contract.md).
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Purpose and ordering
[stderr] +
[stderr] +This is the implementation dependency map for the offline P0 campaign.  The
[stderr] +project workspace currently contains specification artefacts only; it has no
[stderr] +application source tree or selected framework.  Accordingly, the paths below
[stderr] +are *initial ownership boundaries* for the implementation repository rather
[stderr] +than claims about existing code.  Select the engine/framework, content format,
[stderr] +and final browser/device/performance matrix before their dependent work starts.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +Tasks are deliberately small, reviewable increments.  Complete them in numeric
[stderr] +order unless their dependencies show that parallel work is safe.  `PW-*` paths
[stderr] +are reserved future Playwright paths; each browser-impacting task owns one
[stderr] +unique path and may not reuse another task's specification.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +### Planned implementation layout
[stderr] +
[stderr] +```text
[stderr] +src/core/                 deterministic, browser-free rules and state
[stderr] +src/content/              authored package types, source data, validation
[stderr] +src/platform/web/         storage, input, browser capability adapters
[stderr] +src/app/                  semantic shell, renderer integration, UI panels
[stderr] +public/                   manifest, icons, service-worker assets
[stderr] +tests/core/ tests/content/ tests/platform/ tests/app/
[stderr] +supervisor/browser/tests/changes/
[stderr] +docs/                     support, privacy, release, and authoring guidance
[stderr] +```
