[stderr] +failure-mode approval.  Exact engine, storage API, host/CDN, diagnostics
[stderr] +transport, content-editor format, languages, ratings/parental/regional policy,
[stderr] +supported browsers/devices/assistive technology, performance budgets, and
[stderr] +service-worker rollout policy remain decision gates—not invented requirements.
